@team
title: Your team
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1
new-page: true

= Your team

You can keep up to three advisers at a time (now **[+ adv_count +]**). Bringing someone in pleases their faction a little; letting them go angers it more. José Luis Ábalos, your permanent loyalist, and the government's ministers do not count.

**Institutionalists**: keep dissent down and speak to voters and party together. Antonio Hernando[? if adv_hernando = 1 : (on your team) ?], Carmen Calvo[? if adv_calvo = 1 : (on your team) ?], Margarita Robles[? if adv_robles = 1 : (on your team) ?], Rafael Simancas[? if adv_simancas = 1 : (on your team) ?].

**Modernisers**: good governance, pragmatic decisions, liberal and moderate voters. Iván Redondo[? if adv_redondo = 1 : (on your team) ?], Jordi Sevilla[? if adv_sevilla = 1 : (on your team) ?], Manuel Escudero[? if adv_escudero = 1 : (on your team) ?], Eduardo Madina[? if adv_madina = 1 : (on your team) ?].

**Socialist Left**: the base, enthusiasm, good relations with Podemos. Adriana Lastra[? if adv_lastra = 1 : (on your team) ?], José Antonio Pérez Tapias[? if adv_tapias = 1 : (on your team) ?], Odón Elorza[? if adv_elorza = 1 : (on your team) ?], Zaida Cantera[? if adv_cantera = 1 : (on your team) ?].

**Sanchistas**: personal loyalty, sanchismo, your position in the party. César Luena[? if adv_luena = 1 : (on your team) ?], Santos Cerdán[? if adv_cerdan = 1 : (on your team) ?], Óscar Puente[? if adv_puente = 1 : (on your team) ?], Félix Bolaños[? if adv_bolanos = 1 : (on your team) ?].

**Trade Unionists**: the working class and political donations. Toni Ferrer[? if adv_ferrer = 1 : (on your team) ?], Cándido Méndez[? if adv_mendez = 1 : (on your team) ?], Magdalena Valerio[? if adv_valerio = 1 : (on your team) ?], Pepe Álvarez[? if adv_alvarez = 1 : (on your team) ?].

**Regional Barons**: support in their region, calming the barons' plot, moderate voters. Ximo Puig[? if adv_puig = 1 : (on your team) ?], Guillermo Fernández Vara[? if adv_vara = 1 : (on your team) ?], Javier Lambán[? if adv_lamban = 1 : (on your team) ?], Francina Armengol[? if adv_armengol = 1 : (on your team) ?].

- @hire_hernando: Institutionalists: bring in Antonio Hernando
- @fire_hernando: Institutionalists: let Antonio Hernando go
- @hire_calvo: Institutionalists: bring in Carmen Calvo
- @fire_calvo: Institutionalists: let Carmen Calvo go
