@fx_inst_0
title: Keep the party together
subtitle: Dissent falls in every faction.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! ['institutionalists','regional_leaders','progressives','modernisers','trade_unionists'].forEach(function (f) { Q[f + '_dissent'] -= 2; }); Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 2; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

A month of quiet meetings: nobody leaks, nobody resigns.

@fx_inst_1
title: A message for every socialist
subtitle: The PSOE gains a little with every kind of voter, and the party feels united.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.member_morale += 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', { workers: 0.5, professionals: 0.5, pensioners: 0.5, self_employed: 0.4, students: 0.4, unemployed: 0.4, homemakers: 0.4 }); } Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

A speech the whole party can share.

@fx_mod_0
title: Govern well, decide pragmatically
subtitle: More authority; a reputation for competence.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchez_authority += 3; Q.modernisers_dissent -= 3; if (window.SpainGame && Q.player_in_government) { window.SpainGame.econ(Q, 0.1, -0.02); } Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Fewer slogans, more results.

@fx_mod_1
title: Speak to liberal and moderate voters
subtitle: Wins professionals and the self-employed; warmer Cs; the Socialist Left grumbles.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_cs += 3; Q.progressives_dissent += 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'middle', 1.3); } Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

A moderate, modern PSOE for people who never voted for it.

@fx_left_0
title: Fire up the base
subtitle: More enthusiasm among members and supporters.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.member_morale += 5; Q.sanchismo += 2; Q.progressives_dissent -= 3; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Packed halls and red flags.

@fx_left_1
title: Keep the bridge to Podemos open
subtitle: Better relations with Podemos; some of its voters listen.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_up += 7; Q.regional_leaders_dissent += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'up', 'psoe', { students: 0.4, workers: 0.3 }); } Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Coffee with Podemos, in public.

@fx_sanch_0
title: Loyalty first
subtitle: The plot against you weakens; a firmer hold on the Federal Committee.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.plot = Math.max(0, (Q.plot || 0) - 8); Q.federal_committee_balance += 4; Q.sanchez_authority += 2; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Your people in every federation report back.

@fx_sanch_1
title: Build the Sánchez brand
subtitle: Your personal following grows.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 6; Q.populism += 0.5; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

"Pedro" is now a name the members say with affection.

@fx_union_0
title: Stand with the working class
subtitle: Wins workers and the unemployed; the unions approve.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 4; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'working', 1.4); } Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Factory gates at six in the morning.

@fx_union_1
title: Ask the movement for money
subtitle: Party funds from union-linked donors.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.funds += 1.5; Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 1; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

The UGT's friends open their wallets.

@fx_baron_0
title: Campaign in [+ adv_home_region +]
subtitle: Boosts the PSOE in this baron's region.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.regionalMod(Q, Q.adv_home_region, 'psoe', 1.04); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

The regional machine runs at full speed.

@fx_baron_1
title: Calm the other barons
subtitle: The barons' plot weakens; regional barons calmer.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.plot = Math.max(0, (Q.plot || 0) - 10); Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 6; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

One baron vouches for you to the others.

@fx_baron_2
title: Reach moderate voters
