choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', { pensioners: 0.8, self_employed: 0.6, professionals: 0.5 }); } Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Sensible, provincial, reassuring.

